@startuml

start

:Housekeeper identifies issue;

if (Maintenance needed?) then (Yes)

:Create Maintenance Request;

:Add description;
:Attach photo (optional);
:Record voice note;

:Maintenance ticket created;

fork
:Send notification to technician;
fork again
:Open task communication thread;
end fork

:Technician reviews ticket;

:Listen to voice note;

if (Need clarification?) then (Yes)

:Send text message;

or

:Send voice note response;

or

:Start Push-to-Talk conversation;

if (Issue still unclear?) then (Yes)
:Escalate to live call;
endif

endif

:Perform maintenance work;

:Update repair status;

:Attach completion notes/photo;

:Notify housekeeper;

:Verify issue resolved;

:Close ticket;

else (No)

:Update room status;

endif

stop

